            "text": "承运商结论为 LOST 且无有效签收记录时，可按该订单行支付金额全额退款。",
            "chunk_id": "c-01",
            "content_hash": "8e1c9863e3d0fd66d82f51fddfda480e002e12280784d0bbd60f572f23be2a65"
          },
          {
            "bundle_id": "policy-logistics-2026.09",
            "version": "2026.09",
            "rule_id": "R-SIGNED-001",
            "title": "已签收",
            "text": "存在有效签收记录时不予退款；客户主张未收到时须由人工核验后再决定。",
            "chunk_id": "c-02",
            "content_hash": "08209d753b9300c0f82c36180c6ada74646f1df23e7f7112aaa1318e9338ceca"
          },
          {
            "bundle_id": "policy-logistics-2026.09",
            "version": "2026.09",
            "rule_id": "R-DELAY-001",
            "title": "超时未达",
            "text": "承运商结论为 DELAYED 且超过承诺时效 7 天时，可由人工核验后按行支付金额退款。",
            "chunk_id": "c-03",
            "content_hash": "abdac865fbda644a77d2347adae3e05acd9ecb16b6b242d4baad6b6392e8c310"
          },
          {
            "bundle_id": "policy-logistics-2026.09",
            "version": "2026.09",
            "rule_id": "R-RETURN-001",
            "title": "退回在途",
            "text": "承运商结论为 RETURNED 且货物仍在退回途中时，须等待退回签收后再判断，不得先行退款。",
            "chunk_id": "c-04",
            "content_hash": "ea3660129f0898635388d4d875836ec4e2dde1e5df86e8d458c3c1d11a8fb106"
          },
          {
            "bundle_id": "policy-logistics-2026.09",
            "version": "2026.09",
            "rule_id": "R-NOSCAN-7D",
            "title": "七天无扫描",
            "text": "承运商无有效签收且连续 7 天无扫描记录时，视同丢失，可按该订单行支付金额全额退款。",
            "chunk_id": "c-05",
            "content_hash": "ee4167627f619898b41fce34e89719fefc45a4f52e13203e540574759cf72d9b"
          },
          {
            "bundle_id": "policy-logistics-2026.09",
            "version": "2026.09",
            "rule_id": "R-PARTIAL-001",
            "title": "部分退款",
            "text": "同一订单行已发生部分退款时，只可退未退部分，且不得超过该行支付金额。",
            "chunk_id": "c-06",
            "content_hash": "0302b10ea9e5681157c8dd1871f8b5254b53971f428cf10cadb6dbbebc76b90f"
          },
          {
            "bundle_id": "policy-logistics-2026.09",
            "version": "2026.09",
            "rule_id": "R-LOST-EXC-001",
            "title": "丢失规则的例外：高价值行",
            "text": "例外：本规则不适用于支付金额超过 500000 分的订单行，此类行即使结论为 LOST 也不得自动退款，必须转人工。",
            "chunk_id": "c-07",
            "content_hash": "89dcf09c2768068c0377beb8f339f3d3768640c5708d590b846160eec6582d68"
          }
        ],
